          {
            "citations": null,
            "text": "I apologize, but I'm unable to process a refund for order 1002 (Festival ticket, $120.00). \n\nAccording to our refund policy, this order is **not eligible for a refund** because it was a **final-sale purchase**. Our policy states:\n\n**Refund Policy:**\n1. An order is refundable within 30 days of purchase.\n2. **Final-sale items are not refundable.**\n3. The order must have been delivered.\n\nWhile the order was only purchased 2 days ago and has been delivered, the final-sale designation means it cannot be refunded regardless of other conditions.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?",
